{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42064","headline":"送相里秀才之匡山国子监 · 李中","name":"送相里秀才之匡山国子监","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"气秀情闲杳莫羣，庐山游去志求文。\n已能探虎穷骚雅，又欲囊萤就典坟。\n目豁乍窥千里浪，梦寒初宿五峰云。\n业成早赴春闱约，要使嘉名海内闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}